    "done_when": "tests/test_stall_clock_starts_at_the_attempt.py passes: a pointer whose stream's last record is older than the stall window but whose current attempt started 30 seconds ago classifies working, not stalled; the same pointer with an attempt start older than the stall window and no newer record still classifies stalled; a pointer with no attempt start behaves as today; the declared negative control is executed and logged; the gate adds no failures over tests/test_crew_recovery.py, tests/test_crew_watch_stream.py, tests/test_every_attempt_is_supervised.py and tests/test_producer_shares_the_classifier_verdict.py against base 311bfc62; the evidence record carries an anchor",
